---
description: App Factory project registration, quality, and reuse-first rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing this repository, read:

- `.factory/project-context.json`
- `.factory/standard-lock.json`
- `.factory/AGENTS.factory.md`
- `.factory/library-catalog.json`
- `quality/quality-manifest.json`
- relevant project docs and feature contracts
- `docs/REUSABLE_COMPONENTS.md`

The `projectType` field is authoritative. Do not re-scaffold an existing project. Search the reusable-library catalog before implementing cross-cutting infrastructure. Prefer released packages with thin product adapters; otherwise keep local generic modules extraction-ready and documented.

Do not use undisclosed fake production data, disconnected controls, or unverified completion claims. Report checks run and checks not run. `code_complete` is not `done`.
